    "description": "<p>Water cannot be bound. Rivers flow through a man's fingers, ice melts away, and steam escapes into the air. The Immaculate tries to mimic this perfect freedom, using this Charm to prevent herself from ever being restrained. When she uses it, mundane chains shatter, ropes snap, and handcuffs drop away. It also nullifies the effects of supernatural restraints for a number of ticks equal to the Immaculate's (Martial Arts x 3).</p>",
